#
# NOTE: This version uses PROPER SCALED REGULARISATION where:
#   lambda_effective = lambda_base * tr(X'X) / p
#                    = lambda_base * mean(diag(X'X))
# This ensures consistent regularisation strength across dimensions
# by making lambda a fraction of the average information, rather than
# an absolute value that becomes negligible as p grows.
# ============================================================


